@startuml
title W4 — SO30 / CO30 Change waitlist priority
skinparam shadowing false
actor "Administrative Staff" as Staff
participant ":AppointmentTrackingSystem" as System
Staff -> System : changeWaitlistPriority(entry, priority)
alt known WAITING entry and valid staff priority value
  System --> Staff : updated entry details
else unknown/inactive entry or invalid priority
  System --> Staff : rejection reason; no entry change
end
note over System
  Request date and criteria remain unchanged.
  Subsequent candidate queries use the new priority.
end note
@enduml
